# Sample flashcards
# Basic: Front::Back
Capital of France::Paris

# Reversed: Front:::Back produces cards in both directions
Photosynthesis:::The process by which plants convert light energy into chemical energy

# Multi-line: a line containing only ? separates front and back
What is 2 + 2?
?
4

# Cloze: ==highlighted== text becomes the missing answer
The mitochondria is the ==powerhouse== of the cell.
